{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043470/extras/1d7df2687f90b9cecea31c13fb6294fb.avif?t=1761218244\" width=1560 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to\u00a0Aethelgard City, a vast citadel, controlled by a benevolent queen, which takes in any and all refugees. As the former head alchemist of a kingdom that fell in flames, you must re-commence your life from zero in this society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky for you, you are the discoverer of a new type of magic: <strong>Lust Magic!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043470/extras/386b6ee1280bea10b6ed7f88d0882f6c.avif?t=1761218244\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043470/extras_big/386b6ee1280bea10b6ed7f88d0882f6c.avif?t=1761218244 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your spells to increase your influence and rise above your station, and in doing so improve your relationship with the women of the city! As you position yourself better socially, you will be able to unlock special bonds with the women you meet, and in turn have access to special sex scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A medieval fantasy visual novel set in Aethelgard City, where you must harness your lust magic in order to become an influential figure in the kingdom. Get involved with beautiful women and uncover the mystery of your fallen kingdom as you reveal a city-wide conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043470/extras/1da000322d25c16860b37a81806b2254.avif?t=1761218244\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043470/extras_big/1da000322d25c16860b37a81806b2254.avif?t=1761218244 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain experience as you complete tasks for the women of the kingdom;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up by completing increasingly more difficult minigames;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level of <strong>Social Influence</strong>, you will unlock hotter sex scenes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve yourself inside of a rich story that will surprise you at every turn!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043470?t=1761218244","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043470/aafe7c044c30603940223d1d281ea8216168ea71/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761218244","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043470/390cd363e38481e46c3f384ca66b4241ec3ab8c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761218244","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043470/390cd363e38481e46c3f384ca66b4241ec3ab8c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761218244","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The game depicts sex scenes between the protagonist and the women characters. For each female character in-game, the player may unlock special cutscenes that display explicit sexual content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043470/extras/1d7df2687f90b9cecea31c13fb6294fb.avif?t=1761218244\" wi